<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EMC Corp raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EMC Corp raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber said it upgraded EMC Corp to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- EMC Corp raised 1-1/2 to 35-3/8.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
